  "sourceTitle": "Avocado Black Bean Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Avocado Black Bean Salsa\nBy: Kristen\nPublished: Wednesday, August 11, 2010 - 1:20pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cans black beans, rinsed and drained\n2 cobs  fresh sweet corn c\n2 tomatoes, diced\n1 red onion, chopped\n2 avocados, diced\n4 tablespoons lime juice\n2 tablespoons olive oil\n1 tablespoon apple cider vinegar\ncilantro\nsalt& pepper, to taste\ngarlic, to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Prepare all the ingredients as specified and mix together in a large bowl. 2 Add the avocado last.",
